  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Organic Regeneration</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/IcarosRegeneration.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120711221816\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"IcarosRegeneration\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/IcarosRegeneration.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120711221816\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/IcarosRegeneration.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20120711221816 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/IcarosRegeneration.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120711221816 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"IcarosRegeneration\" width=\"270\" height=\"143\" data-image-key=\"IcarosRegeneration.jpg\" data-image-name=\"IcarosRegeneration.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Icaros (666 Satan/O-Parts Hunter) regenerates his arm using maggots.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Regenerate by absorbing organic substances.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>regenerate wounds by absorbing organic substances</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Manipulation\" title=\"Organic Manipulation\">Organic Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can regenerate wounds by absorbing organic substances (including living beings), either to empower their regeneration process or directly transform the organic substances into their own mass.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Absorption\" title=\"Organic Absorption\">Organic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Regeneration\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Regeneration\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Regeneration\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Regeneration\">Absolute Regeneration</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Regeneration\" title=\"Animal Regeneration\">Animal Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Insect_Regeneration\" title=\"Insect Regeneration\">Insect Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Snake_Regeneration\" title=\"Snake Regeneration\">Snake Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Worm_Regeneration\" title=\"Worm Regeneration\">Worm Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Leech_Regeneration\" title=\"Leech Regeneration\">Leech Regeneration</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Brain_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Brain Regeneration\">Brain Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chlorokinetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Chlorokinetic Regeneration\">Chlorokinetic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumptive_Biological_Regeneration\" title=\"Consumptive Biological Regeneration\">Consumptive Biological Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Haemopotent_Regeneration\" title=\"Haemopotent Regeneration\">Haemopotent Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mycokinetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mycokinetic Regeneration\">Mycokinetic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Osteokinetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Osteokinetic Regeneration\">Osteokinetic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trofikinetic_Regeneration\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trofikinetic Regeneration\">Trofikinetic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Xylokinetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Xylokinetic Regeneration\">Xylokinetic Regeneration</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Contaminant_Immunity\" title=\"Contaminant Immunity\">Contaminant Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Manipulation\" title=\"Organic Manipulation\">Organic Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be unable to regenerate their head.</li>\n<li>User either has to be able to generate organic substances or draw organic substances from other sources.</li>\n<li>Users with cellular abilities can destroy the organic substances of the host, thus removing the regeneration abilities.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Icaros (<i>666 Satan/O-Parts Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li>Orochimaru (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Kabuto Yakushi (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Professor James Marcus (<i>Resident Evil</i>)</li>\n<li>Alex Mercer (<i>Prototype</i>)</li>\n<li>James Heller (<i>Prototype 2</i>)</li>\n<li>The Thing Monster (<i>John Carpenter's The Thing</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mortalkombat.fandom.com/wiki/Kytinn\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:mortalkombat:Kytinn\">Kytinn</a> (<i>Mortal Kombat</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mortalkombat.fandom.com/wiki/D%27Vorah\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:mortalkombat:D&#39;Vorah\">D'Vorah</a> (<i>Mortal Kombat</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-058\">SCP-058 - Heart of Darkness</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3036\">SCP-3036 - Stretchy, Clown-Hunter Extraordinaire</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FOrganic_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"7d698cf160b988d1c05ed776a0b33280\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Thing1-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:156px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Thing1.jpg\" title=\"Thing1.jpg (36 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:156px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7d/Thing1.jpg